[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23944.548, "timestamp": "06:39:04", "text": "つまり、ダブル銅はこれらすべてになります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23948.07, "timestamp": "06:39:08", "text": "それでおしまい。ストレージが1つあれば"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23951.75, "timestamp": "06:39:11", "text": "必要なものをすべて入れることができます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23954.51, "timestamp": "06:39:14", "text": "アイテムを取得する、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23958.23, "timestamp": "06:39:18", "text": "など。胸が大きすぎるのは嫌だから。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23960.15, "timestamp": "06:39:20", "text": "今。サーバーが遅延する可能性があり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23963.43, "timestamp": "06:39:23", "text": "今すぐ何か。それはとても不自然に見えるだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23966.27, "timestamp": "06:39:26", "text": "今、私はそう思う。私はしません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23970.07, "timestamp": "06:39:30", "text": "知る。あるいは、できない。でも、そう感じた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23973.51, "timestamp": "06:39:33", "text": "ただ一つ、適切なものを一つ持っていて、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 23977.137, "timestamp": "06:39:37", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Vanilla are fine"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23977.51, "timestamp": "06:39:37", "text": "きちんと整理整頓しておきましょう。例えば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23980.31, "timestamp": "06:39:40", "text": "きちんと整理してください。アーマースタックまたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23982.628, "timestamp": "06:39:42", "text": "何でも。整理整頓しておけば"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23984.03, "timestamp": "06:39:44", "text": "震える。"}]